  "method": "npm run capture:wallpaper:installed. Unretouched native window captures (screencapture -o -x -l, 2560×1600) of the signed public app in one disposable fixture profile per appearance. A capture-only init script fixes the Start Page renderer clock at the top of a sample hour on the capture date; the released wallpaper controller and Billboard clock read that clock. Reduced motion settles each phase without a cross-fade, and each phase is reloaded so the released top-edge sampler tints the native Island strip; the strip tint is measured from the capture. No shipped code, controls, block totals or OS clock are changed. The owner approved these images on October 9, 2026.",
